## The runtime

This game stands on no engine, so the runtime under it is yours to write: the
frame loop and the delta time it measures, the canvas fit, keyboard input, audio
cues, loading the seeded sprite art, and the debug overlay. Where this
specification speaks of the runtime it means that layer, and it states only what
Wireworm needs from it. How the layer is structured is yours to decide.
